[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mThe Noldor are known as the 'Deep-elves', for they are the most\u001b[16;3Hlearned and inventive of the elven kindreds. They saw the light of\u001b[17;3H"]
[0.000, "o", "the Two Trees in Valinor and gained much in lore and skill. They\u001b[18;3Hare tall and lithe, yet so strong of spirit that they can endure\u001b[19;3Hvast hardship. Their hair is mostly dark and their eyes grey.\u001b[22;3HArrow keys navigate the menu    Enter select the current menu item\u001b[23;12H"]
