[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mSinda\u001b[18Gthe 'Grey-elves' who never saw the blessed light of\u001b[16;3H"]
[0.000, "o", "the Two Trees, but who found an echo of it in their queen, Melian \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m \u001b[17;7H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mMaiar. They are less learned and powerful than the Noldor, but\u001b[18;3Hhave fair voices and are gifted in song.\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m\u001b[25X\u001b[19;3H"]
