[0.000, "o", "\u001b[32m\u001b[40msmithing affinity   \u001b[15;7H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mdwarves are stone-hard and stubborn, fast in friendship and in\u001b[16;3H"]
[0.000, "o", "enmity. They live long, far beyond the span of Men but not for \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m   \u001b[17;3H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mever. They are short in stature, deep-breasted and stout in the \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m   \u001b[18;3H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mleg, and their beards are long. They were named the 'Naugrim' by\u001b[K\u001b[19;3Hthe Sindar, meaning 'the stunted people'.\u001b[7;3H"]
